# expect.stdout: 111\n
# expect.exit: 0
project Float64LeGeNe
target console
runtime AgentRuntime 0.1
entry console main
error MainError
errorCase MainError Placeholder Int32
operation main
input operation main console Console
output operation main Result ExitCode MainError
effect main write console.stdout
memory main heap no
async main no
purpose operation main "Exercise math.lessThanOrEqualFloat64, math.greaterThanOrEqualFloat64, and math.notEqualFloat64. Compose three booleans into a 3-digit binary-as-int: 1.0 <= 2.0 (true), 3.0 >= 2.0 (true), 1.0 != 2.0 (true)."
invariant operation main "Each comparison contributes one decimal digit (100, 10, 1) when true."
label startMain
storage module immutable oneFloat Float64 1.0
storage module immutable twoFloat Float64 2.0
storage module immutable threeFloat Float64 3.0
storage module immutable differentFloat Float64 2.0
call leCheckCall math.lessThanOrEqualFloat64
argument leCheckCall left Float64 oneFloat
argument leCheckCall right Float64 twoFloat
run leCheckCall
bind value leResult Bool leCheckCall
call geCheckCall math.greaterThanOrEqualFloat64
argument geCheckCall left Float64 threeFloat
argument geCheckCall right Float64 twoFloat
run geCheckCall
bind value geResult Bool geCheckCall
call neCheckCall math.notEqualFloat64
argument neCheckCall left Float64 oneFloat
argument neCheckCall right Float64 differentFloat
run neCheckCall
bind value neResult Bool neCheckCall
memory main mutable hundredsDigit Int64 0
branch if condition leResult target addHundreds
branch else target maybeTens
label addHundreds
storage module immutable oneHundred Int64 100
set memory hundredsDigit oneHundred
jump target maybeTens
label maybeTens
memory main mutable tensDigit Int64 0
branch if condition geResult target addTens
branch else target maybeOnes
label addTens
storage module immutable ten Int64 10
set memory tensDigit ten
jump target maybeOnes
label maybeOnes
memory main mutable onesDigit Int64 0
branch if condition neResult target addOnes
branch else target composeTotal
label addOnes
storage module immutable oneUnit Int64 1
set memory onesDigit oneUnit
jump target composeTotal
label composeTotal
call sumHTCall math.addInt64
argument sumHTCall left Int64 hundredsDigit
argument sumHTCall right Int64 tensDigit
run sumHTCall
bind value partialHT Int64 sumHTCall
call sumAllCall math.addInt64
argument sumAllCall left Int64 partialHT
argument sumAllCall right Int64 onesDigit
run sumAllCall
bind value composedTotal Int64 sumAllCall
call writeCall console.writeIntegerLine
argument writeCall console Console console
argument writeCall value Int64 composedTotal
run writeCall
ignore void source writeCall
storage module immutable successfulExitCode ExitCode 0
return ok successfulExitCode
